(1, 7232, N'SN_SKILL_CH_BOW_CALL_F_TT_DESC', N'화조를 소환하여 적을 공격하며, 시야를 방해해 명중률을 높인다.\n활을 사용할 때만 가능하다.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'A Fire Hawk is summoned, and it disrupts the enemy''s line of sight, thus increasing the warrior''s accuracy.\nOnly usable with a bow.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 7233, N'SN_SKILL_CH_BOW_CALL_G_TT_DESC', N'대붕을 소환하여 적을 공격하며, 시야를 방해해 명중률을 높인다.\n활을 사용할 때만 가능하다.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'Summons a Roc to attack the enemy.  The enemy''s sight is obstructed, increasing the accuracy of the summoner.\nUsable only when using a bow.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 7234, N'SN_SKILL_CH_BOW_NORMAL_A_TT_DESC', N'힘을 모아 사정거리가 먼 화살을 발사한다.\n활을 사용할 때만 가능하다.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'Launches a long range arrow with all might.\nUsable only when using a bow.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
