(1, 7528, N'SN_SKILL_TRADE_SPEEDUP_STUDY', N'운송 수단을 빠르게 걷게 한다. 운송 수단의 이동 속도가 증가한다.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'Enables the transport vehicle to walk on faster and thus increases the movement speed of the vehicle.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 7529, N'SN_SKILL_TRADE_HIGHSPEEDUP_STUDY', N'운송 수단을 더욱 빠르게 걷게 한다. 운송 수단의 이동 속도가 증가한다.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'Enables the transport vehicle to walk on much faster and thus increases the movement speed of the vehicle.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
