Warriors, who have mastered their physical strength more then others use their powers to protect allies though either their physical talents and sacrifice. With these skills, they have saved many lives of others in numerous battles. Those skills of theirs which allow them to protect others, or face damage that others were meant to suffer, work better in group battles.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 7676, N'EU_WARRIOR_GROUP_FRENZY_TT_DESC', N'프랜지 버스터

강인한 체력과 강한 힘으로 적을 제압하던 워리어들은 적들의 발전된 공격기술과 방어기술에 대하여 대응할 새로운 기술들을 필요로 했다.
게다가 혼자만의 전투보다 동료들과 함께 적과 맞서 싸우는 일이 잦아지면서 자기 자신과 동료를 보호할 기술들도 필요로 했기 때문에 적의 사기를 꺾는 다거나 아군에게 몰려있는 적들의 적의를 자신에게 돌려 아군을 보호하는 등의 기술을 개발하고 발전시켰고 새로운 기술의등장으로 단순히 물리 공격이나 방어를 생각하여 워리어에게 접근한 적들은 커다란 피해를 입을 수 밖에 없었다.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'Frenzy Buster

Warriors who had defeated the enemy based on greater physical strength needed new skills to fight against sophisticated offensive and defensive enemy attacks.
Moreover, as Warriors had to fight the enemy together with their allies rather than alone, they also needed skills to protect themselves as well as others. Therefore, they have developed skills to undermine the enemy''s morale or protect their allies by diverting the enemy''s attacks. With the emergence of these new skills, enemies who approached Warriors simply expecting physical attacks or defense were surprised and soon defeated.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 7677, N'EU_WARRIOR_GROUP_VETERAN_TT_DESC', N'베테랑 버스터

