Bards know how to play music that evokes all kinds of emotions in the heart, and their favorite kind is the music that makes happiness. Bards took the most pleasure from playing for members and the pleasure of members enabled Bards to obtain various skills using the effects of this pleasure.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 7725, N'EU_BARD_GROUP_MELODY_TT_DESC', N'멜로디

