Clerics use their faith to cure wounded people or protect comrades from evil power, substantially contributing to party members. However, they were vulnerable to great damages due to their weak offensive and defensive powers.  Now Clerics are equipped with armor blessed with God''s glory to protect themselves, becoming a tough target for enemies in combat.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 7735, N'EU_CLERIC_GROUP_DIVINE_TT_DESC', N'멘탈 컬쳐

