*The summoned monster will disappear after 5 minutes.<br><br>
Eligible Levels: Lvl.10 and up</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 1902, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_E050815_FABRIC_TT_DESC', N'천조각이다. 조금 지저분하긴 하지만, 잘 빨면 쓸만할 것 같다. 소옥이가 필요하다고 한 것 같으니 갖다 주자.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>a piece of cloth<br>a piece of cloth. looks a bit dirty but seems to be ok if washed. lets bring it to so-ok because she seems to need it.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 1903, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_E050815_FLAGPLE_TT_DESC', N'착지가 들고 있는 창을 잘 다듬어 만든 깃대. 매우 튼튼해 보인다.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>solid pole<br>a flag pole made by refining the spear chakji had hold. it looks very solid.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 1904, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_E050815_KOREAFLAG_M_TT_DESC', N'태극문양과 건곤이감 4괘가 그려진 태극기. 아바타 슬롯에 장착할 수 있다.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>taegeuki<br>taegeuki with taegeuk circle and four signs of geon, gon, i, gam.. usable if equipped into the job slot.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 1905, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_E050815_GOLDKOREAFLAG_M_TT_DESC', N'태극문양과 건곤이감 4괘가 그려진 태극기. 태극기 주변으로 멋진 황금색 자수가 새겨져 있어 저 고급스럽게 보인다. 아바타 슬롯에 장착할 수 있다.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>golden embroidered taegeuki<br>taegeukiwith taegeuk circle and four signs of geon, gon, i, gam. it is nicely golden embroidered around the edge. usable if equipped into the job slot.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 1906, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_E050815_TAEGUKBUNTING_M_TT_DESC', N'거대한 태극기가 걸려있는 휘장이다. 웅장한 모습이 그 가치를 더하고 있다. 아바타 슬롯에 장착할 수 있다.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>taegeuk curtain<br>a huge curtain on which the taegeuki is hanged. its magnificent view adds the value to it. usable if equipped into the job slot.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
