(1, 2069, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_STATS_POINT_RECALL_50LV_BASIC_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>현재 까지 획득한 스탯 포인트를 모두 회수 합니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용조건</font></strong><br>41Lv ~ 50Lv 까지만 사용가능(캐릭터가 도달한 최고 레벨을 기준으로 한다.)</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>All stat points obtained thus far are retrieved.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Instructions</font></strong><br>41Lv ~ Only usable by characters at level 41 to 50 (Based on the highest level achieved by the character.)</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 2070, N'SN_ITEM_QEV_ALL_BASIC2_6_TT_DESC', N'돈황석굴의 불길한 기운을 정화합니다. 돈황석굴 입구 앞에서만 사용할 수 있습니다.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'This flag cleanses the ominous energy in the Donhwang Stone Cave.  It can only be used in front of the entrance into the Donhwang Stone Cave.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 2071, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_GLOBAL_CHATTING_BASIC_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>같은 서버 내의 모든 유저가 볼 수 있는 채팅메시지를 보냅니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>전체채팅 아이템을 사용하면 전체채팅 창이 활성화 되고, 입력란을 통해 채팅메시지를 입력한 후 확인을 누르면 됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>사용 제한 없음.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>Sends a chat message that everyone on the same server can see.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How to use</font></strong><br>When the Global Chat item is clicked, the global chat window will appear. Enter your chat message and then press confirm.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Restriction</font></strong><br>No restrictions on use.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
