(1, 3318, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_TREASUREBOX_KEY_CHALLENGE', N'도전의 열쇠', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'Key of Challenge', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 3319, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_TREASUREBOX_KEY_HERO', N'영웅의 열쇠', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'Key of Hero', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 3320, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_TREASUREBOX_KEY_COURAGE_TT_DESC', N'과거에 진시황제가 진귀한 물건들을 숨겨놓은 용기의 상자를 열 수 있게 해주는 열쇠이다. 하지만 가끔씩은 상자에 숨겨져 있는 기관장치에 의해 피해를 입기도 하니 주의하기를..', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'This chest contains the treasure of Emperor Qin-Shi springs forth the ancient courage.  Only one who holds the Key of Courage may open this chest.  There is a certain mechanism in this mysterious chest so that, depending on the luck of the one who opens it, the opener of the chest may gain rare treasure, be wounded, or face monsters.
May luck smile upon you…
- From an anonymous adventurer -', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 3321, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_TREASUREBOX_KEY_TRIAL_TT_DESC', N'과거에 진시황제가 진귀한 물건들을 숨겨놓은 시련의 상자를 열 수 있게 해주는 열쇠이다. 하지만 가끔씩은 상자에 숨겨져 있는 기관장치에 의해 피해를 입기도 하니 주의하기를..', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'This chest contains the treasure of Emperor Qin-Shi has endured ancient trials.  Only one who holds the Key of Trials may open this chest.  There is a certain mechanism in this mysterious chest so that, depending on the luck of the one who opens it, the opener of the chest may gain rare treasure, be wounded, or face monsters.
May luck smile upon you…
- From an anonymous adventurer -', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 3322, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_TREASUREBOX_KEY_CHALLENGE_TT_DESC', N'과거에 진시황제가 진귀한 물건들을 숨겨놓은 도전의 상자를 열 수 있게 해주는 열쇠이다. 하지만 가끔씩은 상자에 숨겨져 있는 기관장치에 의해 피해를 입기도 하니 주의하기를..', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'This solid chest contains the treasure of Emperor Qin-Shi has been challenged by ancient spirit beings.  Only one who holds the Key of Challenge may open this chest.  There is a certain mechanism in this mysterious chest so that, depending on the luck of the one who opens it, the opener of the chest may gain rare treasure, be wounded, or face monsters.
May luck smile upon you…
- From an anonymous adventurer -', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 3323, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_TREASUREBOX_KEY_HERO_TT_DESC', N'과거에 진시황제가 진귀한 물건들을 숨겨놓은 영웅의 상자를 열 수 있게 해주는 열쇠이다. 하지만 가끔씩은 상자에 숨겨져 있는 기관장치에 의해 피해를 입기도 하니 주의하기를..', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'This chest contains the treasure of Emperor Qin-Shi the spirit of an ancient hero.  Only one who holds the Key of Hero may open this chest.  There is a certain mechanism in this mysterious chest so that, depending on the luck of the one who opens it, the opener of the chest may gain rare treasure, be wounded, or face monsters.
May luck smile upon you…
- From an anonymous adventurer -', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
