(1, 3476, N'SN_ITEM_MALL_OPTLEVEL_UPGRADE_SCROLL_3_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>30분 동안 장비의 강화등급이 3 상승합니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>주문서를 사용한 후 강화할 대상아이템을 선택하면 주문서가 사라지면서 아이템의 강화등급이 오릅니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>장착중에는 사용 할 수 없습니다.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>Equipment enhanced by +3 for 30 minutes.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>Select the target item after right clicking the scroll, the enhancement level of the item increases. The effect begins when it disappears from the inventory.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Restriction</font></strong><br>Cannot be used when you equipped the equipment.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 3477, N'SN_ITEM_MALL_RESURRECTION_SCROLL_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>제 자리에서 부활 합니다. 부활 시 경험치는 복구되지 않습니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>주문서를 사용하면 스스로 부활 할 수 있습니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>사용 제한 없음.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>Resurrect at your current location.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>When you use the scroll, you can resurrect yourself.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Restriction</font></strong><br>None.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 3478, N'SN_ITEM_MALL_RESURRECTION_60P_SCROLL_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>부활 시 경험치가 60% 회복 됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>주문서를 사용하면 스스로 부활 할 수 있습니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>사용 제한 없음.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>Recovers experience points by 60% when resurrected.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>When you use the scroll, you can resurrect yourself.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Restriction</font></strong><br>None</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 3479, N'SN_ITEM_MALL_RESURRECTION_100P_SCROLL_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>부활 시 경험치가 100% 회복 됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>주문서를 사용하면 스스로 부활 할 수 있습니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>사용 제한 없음.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>Recovers experience points by 100% when resurrected.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>When you use the scroll, you can resurrect yourself.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Restriction</font></strong><br>None</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 3480, N'SN_ITEM_EVENT_RESURRECTION_100P_SCROLL_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>부활 시 경험치가 100% 회복 됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>주문서를 사용하면 스스로 부활 할 수 있습니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>사용 제한 없음.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>Recovers experience points by 100% when resurrected.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>When you use the scroll, you can resurrect yourself.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Restriction</font></strong><br>None</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 3481, N'SN_ITEM_MALL_RETURN_SCROLL_HIGH_SPEED_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>대기시간 없이 마을로 귀환합니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>주문서를 사용하면 귀환 할 수 있습니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>사용 제한 없음.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>Returns to the town immediately.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>When you use the scroll, you can return to the town that you select as home.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Restriction</font></strong><br>None</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
