(1, 3482, N'SN_ITEM_EVENT_RETURN_SCROLL_HIGH_SPEED_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>대기시간 없이 마을로 귀환합니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>주문서를 사용하면 귀환 할 수 있습니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>사용 제한 없음.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>Returns to the town immediately.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>When you use the scroll, you can return to the town that you select as home.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Restriction</font></strong><br>None</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 3483, N'SN_ITEM_MALL_REVERSE_RETURN_SCROLL_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>아래의 기능으로 순간이동 할 수 있습니다.<br>1. 최근 귀환서를 사용한 위치<br>2. 최근 죽었던 위치<br>3. 지정된 위치로 이동<br>4. 파티원 위치로 이동<br>5. 지정한 위치로 이동<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>주문서를 사용하면 귀환 할 수 있습니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>사용 제한 없음.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>Can teleport to one of the following three places.<br>1. The location where the return scroll was last used<br>2. The location where you died last<br>3.  Certain Locations which saved in the game system<br>4. Teleport to party members<br>5. Teleport to target area<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>When you right click the scroll, you will return to the location selected.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Restriction</font></strong><br>None</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 3484, N'SN_ITEM_EVENT_REVERSE_RETURN_SCROLL_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>아래의 기능으로 순간이동 할 수 있습니다.<br>1. 최근 귀환서를 사용한 위치<br>2. 최근 죽었던 위치<br>3. 지정된 위치로 이동<br>4. 파티원 위치로 이동<br>5. 지정한 위치로 이동<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>주문서를 사용하면 귀환 할 수 있습니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>사용 제한 없음.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>Can teleport to one of the following three places.<br>1. The location where the return scroll was last used<br>2. The location where you died last<br>3.  Certain Locations which saved in the game system<br>4. Teleport to party members<br>5. Teleport to target area<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>When you right click the scroll, you will return to the location selected.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Restriction</font></strong><br>None</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 3485, N'SN_ITEM_MALL_HP_INC_430_POTION_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>30분 동안 최대hp가 430 증가합니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>물약을 사용하면 상태아이콘이 뜨며 캐릭터의 hp가 증가합니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>동일 효과를 가지는 다른 아이템 및 스킬과 중복 사용 할 수 없습니다.<br>레벨 20 이상 캐릭터만 사용 가능.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>Increases the maximum HP by 430 for 30 minutes.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>When the potion is used, the status icon will appear and the character''s total HP will increase.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Restriction</font></strong><br>Cannot be used with another item or skill that has a similar effect.<br>Use is limited to Lvl.20 and above.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
