(1, 3539, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_FIREWORK_CHAINBOMB_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>작은 폭죽을 연발로 쏩니다.<br>8연발 폭죽입니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>폭죽을 클릭하면 발사됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>사용 제한 없음.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>Launches multiple smaller firecrackers in sequence.<br>8 sequenced firecrackers.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>Click on the firecracker to launch it.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Restriction</font></strong><br>None</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 3540, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_FIREWORK_STAR_SHOWER_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>폭죽이 터지면 화려한 빛무리가 유성우처럼 떨어집니다.<br>단발폭죽입니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>폭죽을 클릭하면 발사됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>사용 제한 없음.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>Creates a firework display like a falling star when it explodes.<br>A single firecracker.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>Click on the firecracker to launch it.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Restriction</font></strong><br>None</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 3541, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_FIREWORK_CROSS_STAR_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>폭죽이 터지면 십자모양으로 커다란 불꽃이 날아갑니다.<br>단발폭죽입니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>폭죽을 클릭하면 발사됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>사용 제한 없음.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>Creates a firework display like a big cross when it explodes.<br>A single firecracker.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>Click on the firecracker to launch it.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Restriction</font></strong><br>None</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 3542, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_FIREWORK_TADPOLE_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>폭죽이 터지면 여러 개의 불꽃이 꼬물고물 날아갑니다.<br>8연발 폭죽입니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>폭죽을 클릭하면 발사됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>사용 제한 없음.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>Launches multiple smaller wiggling firecrackers in sequence.<br>8 sequenced firecrackers.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>Click on the firecracker to launch it.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Restriction</font></strong><br>None</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 3543, N'SN_ITEM_MALL_MABT_CH_M_BANDIT_TIGER_HA_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>맹호의 가죽으로 만든 모자입니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>인벤토리의 아이템을 확장 슬롯에 장착하면 됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>거래 불가 아이템</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>A hat made from a Tiger''s skin.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>Equip the item from the inventory into the extra slot.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Restriction</font></strong><br>Untransferable item</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
