(1, 3551, N'SN_ITEM_MALL_MABT_CH_W_YEOHA_HA_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>여하의 모습을 본떠서 만든 투구입니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>인벤토리의 아이템을 확장 슬롯에 장착하면 됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>거래 불가 아이템</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>A hat made from a Yeoha''s skull.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>Equip the item from the inventory into the extra slot.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Restriction</font></strong><br>Untransferable item</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 3552, N'SN_ITEM_MALL_MABT_CH_W_CHAKJI_HA_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>착지가 착용하던 봉황깃털이 달린 투구입니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>인벤토리의 아이템을 확장 슬롯에 장착하면 됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>거래 불가 아이템</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>A helmet, used by Chagji, decorated with a phoenix feather.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>Equip the item from the inventory into the extra slot.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Restriction</font></strong><br>Untransferable item</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 3553, N'SN_ITEM_MALL_BOOTH_MOB_MANGYANG_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>귀여운 망량 몬스터가 장식된 간판 노점입니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>노점아이템을 사용하면 기본노점이 해당 노점으로 영구적 변경됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>사용 제한 없음.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>A cute Mangryang monster stall decoration.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>When this item is used, the stall will display the decoration permanently.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Restriction</font></strong><br>None</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 3554, N'SN_ITEM_MALL_BOOTH_MOB_BIGEYEGHOST_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>귀여운 대안귀 몬스터가 장식된 간판 노점입니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>노점아이템을 사용하면 기본노점이 해당 노점으로 영구적 변경됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>사용 제한 없음.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>A cute Big-eyed Ghost stall decoration.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>When this item is used, the stall will display the decoration permanently.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Restriction</font></strong><br>None</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 3555, N'SN_ITEM_MALL_BOOTH_MOB_EARTHGHOST_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>귀여운 토귀 몬스터가 장식된 간판 노점입니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>노점아이템을 사용하면 기본노점이 해당 노점으로 영구적 변경됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>사용 제한 없음.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>A cute Earth Ghost stall decoration.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>When this item is used, the stall will display the decoration permanently.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Restriction</font></strong><br>None</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 3556, N'SN_ITEM_MALL_BOOTH_SPECIAL_MONSTER_01_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>토귀, 망량, 대안귀 몬스터가 장식된 스페셜 간판 노점입니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>노점아이템을 사용하면 기본노점이 해당 노점으로 영구적 변경됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>사용 제한 없음.</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>A cute Earth Ghost, Mangryang, and Big-eyed Ghost stall decoration.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>When this item is used, the stall will display the decoration permanently.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Restriction</font></strong><br>None</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
