(1, 9136, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_MOON_PIECE_BLACK', N'검은 달의 파편', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'Black Moon''s Pieces', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 9137, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_MOON_POT_TT_DESC', N'달의 축복을 위해 마법사들이 만든 항아리. 소옥을 통해 얻을 수 있다', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'A pot made by magicians to receive the Moon''s Blessing. You can obtain it through So-Ok.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 9138, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_MOON_GEM_TT_DESC', N'몬스터 몸 속에 숨겨져있던 달의 조각. 원기를 회복하는 기능이 있다. 10개를 모아 소옥이에게 가져가자', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'A moon piece that was hidden inside the monster''s body. It helps recover energy. Collect 10 and take them to So-Ok.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 9139, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_MOON_PIECE_RED_TT_DESC', N'붉은 달의 축복이 담겨진 조각. 소옥이를 통해 값진 선물을 얻을 수 있다', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'Pieces containing the Red Moon''s Blessing. You can receive valuable gifts through So-Ok.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 9140, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_MOON_PIECE_BLACK_TT_DESC', N'검은 달의 축복이 담겨진 조각. 소옥이를 통해 값진 선물을 얻을 수 있다', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'Pieces containing the Black Moon''s Blessing. You can receive valuable gifts through So-Ok.', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 9141, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_SUMMON_FLOWER_01', N'마향초', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'Evil Scented Flower', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
