(1, 9145, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_SUMMON_FLOWER_05', N'비설초', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'Whirling Snow Flower', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 9146, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_SUMMON_FLOWER_01_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>마력을 품은 향기로 주변 몬스터를 현혹하여 발걸음을 돌리게 만드는 꽃<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>꽃을 마우스 우클릭 후 캐릭터 주변 바닥을 클릭하면 해당 위치에 꽃이 생성됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용효과</font></strong><br>주변 범위 20m 이내의 몬스터에게 10분간 어그로를 획득합니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>마을, 요새전에서 사용 불가</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>Flower with an evil scent that attracts monsters and makes them turn their heads<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>Click the right mouse button on the flower and click the ground around the character to create a flower.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Use effect</font></strong><br>Aggro buff is acquired and can be used to the monsters which are within the range of 20m for 10 minutes.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Conditions</font></strong><br>Cannot be used in the fortress war and in towns</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 9147, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_SUMMON_FLOWER_02_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>사물을 흐리게 만드는 강렬한 향기로 주변 몬스터들의 움직임을 둔화시키는 꽃<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>꽃을 마우스 우클릭 후 캐릭터 주변 바닥을 클릭하면 해당 위치에 꽃이 생성됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용효과</font></strong><br>주변 범위 20m 이내의 몬스터에게 10분간 둔화가 적용됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>마을, 요새전에서 사용 불가</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>Flower that makes the movement of monsters around it dull due to its strong scent and makes things appear faded.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>Click the right mouse button on the flower and click the ground around the character to create a flower.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Use effect</font></strong><br>Slowdown effect is applied to monsters which are within the range of 20m for 10 minutes.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Conditions</font></strong><br>Cannot be used in the fortress war and in towns</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
