(1, 9208, N'SN_ZONE_11053', N'잡화점', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'Grocery Shop', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 9148, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_SUMMON_FLOWER_03_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>극악의 환경에서 자라는 탓에 바닥 속 뿌리의 양분으로 주변 사물에 기를 보충해주는 강한 생존력을 지닌 꽃<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>꽃을 마우스 우클릭 후 캐릭터 주변 바닥을 클릭하면 해당 위치에 꽃이 생성됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용효과</font></strong><br>주변 범위 20m 이내의 파티원에게 10분간 HP/MP가 3%씩 회복됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>마을, 요새전에서 사용 불가</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>A flower with great survival power that can live in extreme conditions due to the nourishment of its roots in the ground and provides objects around it with energy.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>Click the right mouse button on the flower and click the ground around the character to create a flower.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Use effect</font></strong><br>HP and MP are recovered 3% every 5 seconds for party members who are within 20m range for 10 minutes.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Conditions</font></strong><br>Cannot be used in the fortress war and in towns</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 9149, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_SUMMON_FLOWER_04_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>막힌 혈도를 풀어 최상의 능력치를 이끌어내는 능력으로 약재상들이 귀하게 여기는 꽃<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>꽃을 마우스 우클릭 후 캐릭터 주변 바닥을 클릭하면 해당 위치에 꽃이 생성됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용효과</font></strong><br>주변 범위 20m 이내의 파티원에게 10분간 물리/마법 공격력 15% 상승됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>마을, 요새전에서 사용 불가</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>Flower considered valuable by medicinal herb salesmen for its ability to relieve clogged blood islands and bring out the best skills.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>Click the right mouse button on the flower and click the ground around the character to create a flower.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Use effect</font></strong><br>Physical and Magical attack power are increased 15% for party members who are within 20m range for 10 minutes.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Conditions</font></strong><br>Cannot be used in the fortress war and in towns</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
(1, 9150, N'SN_ITEM_ETC_SUMMON_FLOWER_05_TT_DESC', N'<sml2>마치 폭설과 같이 꽃가루가 휘날리며 주변의 일부 충격이 흡수되는 효과를 지닌 꽃<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용방법</font></strong><br>꽃을 마우스 우클릭 후 캐릭터 주변 바닥을 클릭하면 해당 위치에 꽃이 생성됩니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">사용효과</font></strong><br>주변 범위 20m 이내의 파티원에게 10분간 물리/마법 데미지 15% 흡수합니다.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">조건</font></strong><br>마을, 요새전에서 사용 불가</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'<sml2>Flower with pollen that flies away like a snowstorm and can absorb shock to a certain extent.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">How To Use</font></strong><br>Click the right mouse button on the flower and click the ground around the character to create a flower.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Use effect</font></strong><br>15% of Physical and Magical damage are absorbed from party members who are within 20m range and will be effective for 10 minutes.<br><br><strong><font color="255,236,219,156">Conditions</font></strong><br>Cannot be used in the fortress war and in towns</sml2>', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0', N'0'),
